          "id": "614922acf4f5751029a8cd1e60ecd1841fd21707",
          "message": "[chore][cmd/mdatagen] Fix generated config validation tests for schemas without defaults (#16131)\n\n<!--Ex. Fixing a bug - Describe the bug and how this fixes the issue.\nEx. Adding a feature - Explain what this achieves.-->\n#### Description\n\nUpdate mdatagen’s generated config tests to handle required fields only\nwhen validation emits a required check. For schema definitions without\ndefaults, initialize test configs with their zero value, and skip the\ndefault-valid test when defaults are intentionally ignored.\n\n<!--Authorship attestation. See AGENTS.md for details. AI agents must\nnot check this box on behalf\nof the user; the human author must check it themselves before the PR is\nready for review.-->\n#### Authorship\n\n- [x] I, a human, wrote this pull request description myself.\n\n<!--Please delete paragraphs that you did not use before submitting.-->",
