          "distinct": false,
          "id": "6320bf6904fb949dc6f2ff19302126b96ea9e70d",
          "message": "Update open-telemetry/shared-workflows action to v0.20.0 (#16165)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[open-telemetry/shared-workflows](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows)\n| workflow | minor | `v0.19.0` → `v0.20.0` |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>open-telemetry/shared-workflows</summary>\n\n###\n[`v0.20.0`](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/releases/tag/v0.20.0)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/compare/v0.19.0...v0.20.0)\n\n<!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml\nat v0.20.0 -->\n\n##### What's Changed\n\n- Promote pull request dashboard to v0.19.0 by\n[@&#8203;otelbot-shared-workflows](https://redirect.github.com/otelbot-shared-workflows)\\[bot]\nin\n[#&#8203;449](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/449)\n- Separate live dashboard refreshes from maintenance work by\n[@&#8203;trask](https://redirect.github.com/trask) in\n[#&#8203;453](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/453)\n- Bump scorecard-action to 2.5.0 + revert local workaround by\n[@&#8203;Kielek](https://redirect.github.com/Kielek) in\n[#&#8203;457](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/457)\n- Remove dashboard code_ref compatibility after promotion by\n[@&#8203;trask](https://redirect.github.com/trask) in\n[#&#8203;438](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/438)\n- Isolate Git checkouts for queue-owned dashboard processors by\n[@&#8203;trask](https://redirect.github.com/trask) in\n[#&#8203;454](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/454)\n- Handle Copilot review quota exhaustion by\n[@&#8203;trask](https://redirect.github.com/trask) in\n[#&#8203;452](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/452)\n- Add snapshot-only storage for generated data branches by\n[@&#8203;trask](https://redirect.github.com/trask) in\n[#&#8203;436](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/436)\n- Add Go repositories to the pull request dashboard by\n[@&#8203;MrAlias](https://redirect.github.com/MrAlias) in\n[#&#8203;458](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/458)\n\n##### New Contributors\n\n- [@&#8203;Kielek](https://redirect.github.com/Kielek) made their first\ncontribution in\n[#&#8203;457](https://redirect.github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/pull/457)\n\n**Full Changelog**:\n<https://github.com/open-telemetry/shared-workflows/compare/v0.19.0...v0.20.0>\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - \"on tuesday\"\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you\nare satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xNTUuMiIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjE1NS4yIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiLCJyZW5vdmF0ZWJvdCJdfQ==-->\n\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
