          "distinct": true,
          "id": "42ee5d39b18f24c206cca3f91f8b0877424bdfee",
          "message": "Update module github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2 to v2.15.0 (#16206)\n\nThis PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Change |\n[Age](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n[Confidence](https://docs.renovatebot.com/merge-confidence/) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n|\n[github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2](https://redirect.github.com/golangci/golangci-lint)\n| `v2.14.0` → `v2.15.0` |\n![age](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/age/go/github.com%2fgolangci%2fgolangci-lint%2fv2/v2.15.0?slim=true)\n|\n![confidence](https://developer.mend.io/api/mc/badges/confidence/go/github.com%2fgolangci%2fgolangci-lint%2fv2/v2.14.0/v2.15.0?slim=true)\n|\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>golangci/golangci-lint\n(github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/v2)</summary>\n\n###\n[`v2.15.0`](https://redirect.github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/blob/HEAD/CHANGELOG.md#v2150)\n\n[Compare\nSource](https://redirect.github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/compare/v2.14.0...v2.15.0)\n\n*Released on 2026-10-16*\n\n1. Linters new features or changes\n   - `errcheck`: from 1.20.0 to 1.30.0\n   - `exhaustive`: from 0.13.0 to 0.15.0 (⚠️ changes)\n   - `gocognit`: from 1.2.1 to 1.3.0\n   - `golines`: from 0.15.0 to 0.16.0\n   - `govet-modernize`: from 0.50.0 to 0.52.0\n   - `loggercheck`: from 0.12.0 to 0.13.0\n   - `predeclared`: from 0.2.2 to 0.3.0\n   - `wrapcheck`: from 2.12.0 to 2.13.0\n2. Linters bug fixes\n   - `bidichk`: from 0.3.3 to 0.3.4\n- `canonicalheader`: from\n[`a25c71c`](https://redirect.github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/commit/a25c71c521f6)\nto\n[`e18e5c5`](https://redirect.github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/commit/e18e5c5a078f)\n   - `gofumpt`: improve deprecation logs\n   - `gosec`: improve concurrency default value\n   - `iface`: from 1.5.1 to 1.5.3\n   - `paralleltest`: from 1.0.15 to 1.0.16\n   - `revive`: from 1.17.0 to 1.17.1\n- `revive`: the rules `context-keys-type`, `errorf`,\n`modifies-value-receiver`, `range-val-address`, `string-of-int`,\n`time-equal`, `time-naming`, `unexported-return`, `unhandled-error`,\n`var-declaration` are working (less randomly).\n- `rowserrcheck`: from\n[`c5f79b8`](https://redirect.github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/commit/c5f79b8a11ba)\nto\n[`e0740d5`](https://redirect.github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/commit/e0740d52dee8)\n   - `staticcheck`: from 0.8.1 to 0.8.2\n3. Bug fixes\n   - fix: compute custom version hash with module versions\n   - fix: env vars loading (related to `revive`)\n\n⚠️ Changes of the `exhaustive` linter:\n\n- The replaced options still exists, and partially works, but they are\ndeprecated.\n- The options `explicit-exhaustive-switch` and `explicit-exhaustive-map`\nhave been replaced by `explicit-exhaustive`.\n- The `check` the value `map` has been replaced by `mapliteral`.\n- The option `ignore-enum-members` (string) has been replaced by\n`ignore-constants` (slice).\n- The option `ignore-enum-types` (string) has been replaced by\n`ignore-types` (slice).\n- New report messages.\n- The linter is a now a \"slow\" linter.\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Configuration\n\n📅 **Schedule**: (UTC)\n\n- Branch creation\n  - \"on tuesday\"\n- Automerge\n  - At any time (no schedule defined)\n\n🚦 **Automerge**: Disabled by config. Please merge this manually once you\nare satisfied.\n\n♻ **Rebasing**: Whenever PR becomes conflicted, or you tick the\nrebase/retry checkbox.\n\n🔕 **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update\nagain.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] <!-- rebase-check -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check\nthis box\n\n---\n\nThis PR was generated by [Mend Renovate](https://mend.io/renovate/).\nView the [repository job\nlog](https://developer.mend.io/github/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector).\n\n<!--renovate-debug:eyJjcmVhdGVkSW5WZXIiOiI0NC4xNjQuMSIsInVwZGF0ZWRJblZlciI6IjQ0LjE2NC4xIiwidGFyZ2V0QnJhbmNoIjoibWFpbiIsImxhYmVscyI6WyJkZXBlbmRlbmNpZXMiLCJyZW5vdmF0ZWJvdCJdfQ==-->\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: renovate[bot] <29139614+renovate[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Yang Song <songy23@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Alex Boten <223565+codeboten@users.noreply.github.com>",
